        "number": 1,
        "text": "Mia and Lily are in the park. They look for animals. \"Look!\" says Mia. \"Is it a cat?\" \"No!\" says Lily. \"It is a frog!\" The frog is green. It can jump."
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "text": "A bee is on a flower. The flower is pink. The bee can fly. \"Is it a bird?\" asks Lily. \"No, it is a bee,\" says Mia. Then Mia sees a spider. It is small and black. \"Is it a friend?\" asks Lily. Mia smiles. \"Yes, it is.\""
      },
      {
        "number": 3,
        "text": "Pip looks at the frog. Pip jumps. The frog jumps. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Mia and Lily smile. \"Pip is funny!\""
      }
